@startuml WelcomeOnboardingFlow
!theme plain
title LedgerGuard - Hybrid Welcome & Onboarding Flow

skinparam ActivityBackgroundColor White
skinparam ActivityBorderColor #2563EB
skinparam ActivityFontSize 12
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #F8FAFC
skinparam NoteBorderColor #94A3B8

|#E8F0FE|Firebase|
|#FFF3E0|Backend|
|#E8F5E9|Webhook|
|#F3E5F5|Postmark|
|#E0F7FA|Flutter|

|Firebase|
start
:User signs up\n(Email/Password or Google);

|Backend|
:Auth Middleware\nverifies Firebase token;
if (User exists in DB?) then (yes)
  :Load existing user;
  |Flutter|
  :Show Dashboard;
  stop
else (no)
  :Create new user\n(role=OWNER, plan=FREE,\nonboarding_completed_at=NULL);
  :Fire ""user.created"" event;
  note right
    Webhook payload:
    event: user.created
    user_id, email,
    plan_tier, created_at
  end note
endif

|Webhook|
:POST to configured URL\n(HMAC-SHA256 signed);
note right
  Destination options:
  .. n8n (default) ..
  .. Customer.io ..
  .. Brevo ..
  .. ActiveCampaign ..
  .. Any custom endpoint ..
end note

|Postmark|
:Send Welcome Email\n(Day 0: immediate);

|Flutter|
:User lands on Dashboard\n(first login);
:GET /api/v1/users/onboarding-status;

|Backend|
:Return status\n{is_complete: false,\nnext_step, has_partner, has_apps};

|Flutter|
:Show Onboarding Checklist Banner;
note right
  Checklist:
  [x] Sign up
  [ ] Connect Shopify Partner
  [ ] Select an App
  [ ] View Dashboard Metrics
  [ ] Try AI Chat
end note

:User completes a step;

|Backend|
:POST /api/v1/users/onboarding-step;
:Record step completion;
:Fire ""onboarding.step_completed""\nevent to webhook;

|Webhook|
:Cancel pending drip email\nfor completed step;

|Flutter|
:Update checklist UI\n(animate checkmark);

if (All steps complete?) then (yes)
  |Backend|
  :POST /api/v1/users/onboarding-complete;
  :Set onboarding_completed_at = NOW();
  :Fire ""onboarding.completed"" event;

  |Webhook|
  :Cancel all remaining drip emails;

  |Postmark|
  :Send completion email\n(You are all set!);

  |Flutter|
  :Hide checklist\nShow success message;
else (no)
  |Postmark|
  if (Day 1 & partner not connected?) then (send)
    :Send Connect Shopify email;
  else (skip)
  endif
  if (Day 3 & dashboard not viewed?) then (send)
    :Send Explore Dashboard email;
  else (skip)
  endif
  if (Day 7 & AI chat not tried?) then (send)
    :Send Try AI Chat email;
  else (skip)
  endif

  |Flutter|
  :Continue showing checklist;
endif

|Flutter|
:Dashboard with full functionality;
note right
  **Webhook Security:**
  HMAC-SHA256 signature
  Timestamp header
  Idempotency key
  Retry: 3x (1s, 5s, 30s)
  ....
  **Config (env vars):**
  WELCOME_WEBHOOK_URL
  WELCOME_WEBHOOK_SECRET
end note
stop

@enduml
